# These PDFs are binary. Without this, Git's text heuristic sees the newlines
# inside them and — with core.autocrlf=true, which is the default on Windows and
# what this cohort is running — rewrites LF as CRLF on checkout. That shifts
# every byte offset in the PDF's xref table, so the file differs between
# machines and stricter PDF tools reject it.
*.pdf binary
